# Base64 Encoding & Decoding in Lateralus (`stdlib/base64.ltl`)

This tutorial covers the usage of `stdlib/base64.ltl` and `std/encoding/base64.ltl` for RFC 4648 compliant Base64 encoding and decoding in Lateralus, including standard alphabets, URL-safe variants, padding configuration, streaming encoders, and standard test vectors.

---

